    "title": "Our country is in deep trouble | Letters | timesnews.net",
    "text": "If you believe as I do that deficits, debt, immigration, foreign policy, Social Security, Medicare, Medicaid, income distribution curve, climate change, and education have not been adequately addressed by the current or previous administrations of Republicans and Democrats, then you must agree that a real opportunity exists for the opposition party to propose meaningful, useful, fiscally responsible solutions to these issues.",
